       (most notably --qquuiieett, see
        Common Options ⟨index.html#commonoptions⟩ ),  ppppmmddrraaww  recognizes  the
       following command line options:




       --ssccrriipptt==_s_c_r_i_p_t
              This option gives the script.  See Script ⟨#script⟩ .

              You may not specify both --ssccrriipptt and --ssccrriippttffiillee.


       --ssccrriippttffiillee==_f_i_l_e_n_a_m_e
              This  option  names  a  file  that contains the script.  -- means
